./ R 00386000          $ 00386100 100                                           
         ISKE  R15,R15       GET THE REAL STORAGE KEY          XA0022DK         
./ R 00401000          $ 00401100 100                                           
         ISKE  R15,R15       GET THE REAL STORAGE KEY          XA0022DK         
./ R 00410000          $ 00410100 100                                           
         ISKE  R15,R15       GET THE REAL STORAGE KEY          XA0022DK         
./ R 00438000          $ 00438100 100                                           
         ISKE  R15,R15       GET THE REAL STORAGE KEY          XA0022DK         
./ R 00444000          $ 00444100 100                                           
         ISKE  R15,R15       GET THE REAL STORAGE KEY          XA0022DK         
./ R 00646000 00647000 $ 00646100 100                                           
*  HSCH FOR HIO. NO STORAGE AND NO CONDITION-CODE WORK: THE    XA0022DK         
*  BC 8+1,EXTEXIT BELOW MEANS THE SAME THING UNDER HSCH. R1    XA0022DK         
*  IS FREE -- NOTHING READS IT AGAIN, AND EACH RETRY RELOADS   XA0022DK         
*  IT.                                                         XA0022DK         
         L     R1,RDEVSSID    SUBSYSTEM ID FROM THE RDEVBLOK   XA0022DK         
         HSCH  0              HALT ACTIVE I/O                  XA0022DK         
         BC    2,HALTCON      CC = 2, BURST OPERATION HALTED   XA0022DK         
./ R 00651000          $ 00651100 100                                           
*  TSCH FOR TIO. THE NEXT INSTRUCTION IS BCT, SO NEITHER THE   XA0022DK         
*  CSW NOR THE CONDITION CODE IS EVER LOOKED AT -- THIS ONLY   XA0022DK         
*  CONSUMES PENDING STATUS. THE IRB IS THEREFORE WRITE-ONLY    XA0022DK         
*  AND A SHARED SCRATCH AREA IS CORRECT, NOT JUST CONVENIENT.  XA0022DK         
*  I-75.                                                       XA0022DK         
         L     R1,RDEVSSID    SUBSYSTEM ID FROM THE RDEVBLOK   XA0022DK         
         TSCH  PSAXIRB        DRAIN IT; THE IRB IS DISCARDED   XA0022DK         
./ I 00665000 $ 00665010 010                                                    
*  WRITE-ONLY IRB FOR THE TSCH ABOVE. SIXTY-FOUR BYTES,        XA0022DK         
*  FULLWORD ALIGNED -- TSCH TAKES A SPECIFICATION EXCEPTION    XA0022DK         
*  OTHERWISE. NOTHING READS IT, SO NO PATH CAN BE HARMED BY    XA0022DK         
*  ANOTHER WRITING IT.                                         XA0022DK         
PSAXIRB  DS    16F            IRB, WRITTEN AND DISCARDED       XA0022DK         
